<title>USA: Carnival Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Carnival Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>CARNIVAL CORPORATION</p>
<p>			THREE MONTHS ENDED	  FISCAL YEAR ENDED</p>
<p>				 NOVEMBER 30,	 NOVEMBER 30,</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenues	     $475.0     $452.9    $2,212.6    $1,998.2</p>
<p>(millions)</p>
<p> Net Income	    114.8	 84.2	 566.3	 451.1</p>
<p>(millions)</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share    .39	  .30	  1.95	  1.59</p>
